# One line ending everywhere: LF in the repo and in the working copy. The room builder and the other tools write LF,
# GameMaker reads it, and mixed endings break exact-match edits. (Overrides a system-wide core.autocrlf.)
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
